        {
            "structuredValue": [],
            "parallelValue": [],
            "groupedValue": [],
            "value": "This thesis will detail my role in the Stanford High-Performance Networking group working on the NetFPGA project. NetFPGA is a customizable software and hardware solution aimed at allowing students to create network hardware that most accurately simulates real-world network hardware. I am specifically working on the second-generation NetFPGA board.",
